    {
      "statement": "AgentDojo exposes a configurable benchmark runner that composes a selected task suite and user tasks with a specified LLM, defense, and attack—such as a tool-filter defense against a tool-knowledge attack—and can scale the same configuration across all suites and tasks, with outputs inspectable through a dedicated results page and benchmark registry.",
